orces agreement chavistas\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-05-oddlots-巴西大选次轮变成对首轮领先者的公投-押注87-的预测市场全错/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">32:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1105</span></div>\n<h2>巴西大选次轮变成对首轮领先者的公投，押注87%的预测市场全错</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">因为选民厌恶现任者，首轮投票选出的「赢家」反而把全部火力引向自己，让原本落后的卢拉在次轮完成反超。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">拉美政治</span><span class=\"tag\">巴西大选</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Health Insurance in America Blue Cross Red Scare Campaigns, Inc. wage and price controls\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-05-throughline-锁定美国雇主医保的不是二战意外-而是艾森豪威尔的选择/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1989x1989+0+0/resize/3000/quality/66/format/jpg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F02%2F15%2Fa2ebac794881a9c592b8881be551%2F4c34746d-230d-4248-8438-6f7a55f11d5f.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">52:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Throughline</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1105</span></div>\n<h2>锁定美国雇主医保的不是二战意外，而是艾森豪威尔的选择</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">二战工资管制只是让雇主医保偶然发芽，真正让它变成美国永久制度的，是1950年代艾森豪威尔政府主动把这项税收优惠永久写进法律。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">医保史</span><span class=\"tag\">雇主医保</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Britain&#x27;s First Homo Sapiens LRJ (Lincombeian-Ranisian-Jerzmanowician) leaf points marine isotope stage 3 (MIS3) prism system Aurignacian\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-05-ancients-英国最早智人化石的年代-可能被保存用的胶水测错了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cb5d9c468a9839ac-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">53:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">The Ancients</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1105</span></div>\n<h2>英国最早智人化石的年代，可能被保存用的胶水测错了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">这块1927年出土的下颌骨被测定为三万五千年前，但修复用的胶水会让放射性碳测年失真，研究者认为实际年代应该更早。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">旧石器时代</span><span class=\"tag\">尼安德特人</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How To Think About Angel Investors As A Solo Founder | Julian Weisser, Solo Founders pulling the thread co-founder of convenience / co-founder of strength key man risk\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-05-solofounders-创业公司死于合伙人分手-独立创始人死于失去希望/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/37e9a6bbbf712536-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">48:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">单人创始人</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1105</span></div>\n<h2>创业公司死于合伙人分手，独立创始人死于失去希望</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">研究显示约三分之二的创业公司因团队问题而死，合伙人分手是头号杀手；独立创始人没有这个风险，但要独自扛住孤立感和失去动量的风险。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">天使投资</span><span class=\"tag\">独立创始人</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"720. Revolution in the Soviet Empire: Revenge of the Red Army (Part 2) Goulash Communism Operation Whirlwind Presidium\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-05-restishistory-匈牙利宣布退出华沙条约-其实在苏军已经打进来之后/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4411977400325163-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:11:08</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Rest Is History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1105</span></div>\n<h2>匈牙利宣布退出华沙条约，其实在苏军已经打进来之后</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">纳吉在电台宣布中立、退出华沙条约时，苏联军队其实已经越过边境，这是绝望之举而非挑衅，却也没能换来联合国或西方任何实质援助。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">冷战史</span><span class=\"tag\">匈牙利1956年革命</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"410. JFK: Blood On The Streets Of Dallas (Part 4) magic bullet theory grassy knoll Warren Commission Zapruder film\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-05-empirehist-阴谋论经久不衰-是因为人们不愿接受一个小人物能扳倒总统/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6dcfd4bf69c91d0f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">56:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Empire 世界史</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1105</span></div>\n<h2>阴谋论经久不衰，是因为人们不愿接受一个小人物能扳倒总统</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">普利策传记作者说，法证证据有力指向奥斯瓦尔德独自开枪，他认为人们抗拒这个结论，是因为不愿相信如此重大的历史转折只凭一个边缘人物就能达成。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">肯尼迪遇刺</span><span class=\"tag\">阴谋论</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"WWI&#x27;s Stalingrad: The Siege of Przemyśl Galicia little Russians ring of steel guncotton Battle of Gorlice-Tarnów\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-05-historyhit-一发受潮的炸药-可能让一战没有在1915年结束/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bda40672b88b5654-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">58:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History Hit</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1105</span></div>\n<h2>一发受潮的炸药，可能让一战没有在1915年结束</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一座碉堡的大门因炸药受潮当夜没被炸开，奥匈帝国侥幸没有当场崩溃——节目认为，这类偶然正是一战没有在1915年结束、反而打到1918年的关键之一。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">一战</span><span class=\"tag\">东线战场</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"19.AI眼镜杀手级应用在哪里？影目杨龙昇先给了个相亲的答案 BB方案 PMF SLAM inside out\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-05-tanpai-市场都在看好ai眼镜-这位创始人说明后两年更难/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/68d3da25c54fc635-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"摊\"><span class=\"dur\">1:04:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">摊牌｜创业观察</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1105</span></div>\n<h2>市场都在看好AI眼镜，这位创始人说明后两年更难</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他判断当前眼镜市场规模只有两三百万台，还要被苹果、Meta和国内大厂挤压，真正的拐点要等供应链、内容生态和产品同时成熟的2028至2029年。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI眼镜</span><span class=\"tag\">AR</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"At The Money: How Do Financial Professionals Invest Their Own Money? spreadsheet optimal behaviorally optimal\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-04-mastersinbiz-连理财专家也提前还房贷-留过多现金-只为心安/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d1b7885ac5e511e1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">23:42</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Masters in Business</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1104</span></div>\n<h2>连理财专家也提前还房贷、留过多现金——只为心安</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">50位基金经理、顾问在新书里坦白：明知提前还房贷、持有超额现金在数学上不划算，他们还是这么做了，因为心理安稳比理论回报更重要。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">行为金融</span><span class=\"tag\">财富管理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Good Fight Club: Trump Rebuked emotional capture rings of commitment stolen pride blue tsunami gerrymandering competitive authoritarianism\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-04-goodfight-特朗普选民没有觉醒-只是外层支持被生活成本层层剥落/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75b9a8ba0dff85c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">The Good Fight</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1104</span></div>\n<h2>特朗普选民没有觉醒，只是外层支持被生活成本层层剥落</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">物价、汽油和住房成本把特朗普的情感俘获一层层剥开，却没有击穿那个仍然忠诚的核心选民群体。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美国政治</span><span class=\"tag\">中期选举</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How To Go From Researcher to Founder CCG CQC SME\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-04-ycsp-说不清解决什么问题-nhs里就没人知道该为你买单/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/968e72a6de5d364b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">9:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Y Combinator</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1104</span></div>\n<h2>说不清解决什么问题，NHS里就没人知道该为你买单</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">每个创业者都该能一句话说清解决了谁的问题，这样才能被导向NHS里真正管那件事的人，再问他愿不愿意付钱——这才是医疗创业的起点。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">医疗创新</span><span class=\"tag\">NHS</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Bernhard von Gudden: Ludwig II’s Psychiatrist somatic psychiatry non-restraint policy retrospective diagnosis Pick&#x27;s disease\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-04-stuffmissed-写报告前-医生没见过那位被判精神失常的国王/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">35:55</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1104</span></div>\n<h2>写报告前，医生没见过那位被判精神失常的国王</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">路德维希二世被废黜的依据，是一份古登从未问诊国王本人、只凭政敌证词写成的精神病报告；两人随后双双溺毙，死因至今成谜。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">精神医学史</span><span class=\"tag\">王室秘闻</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Richard Hanania on Conrad&#x27;s Nostromo, Latin American Crime, and Populism material interests negro liberalism\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-04-tyler-一本写于1904年的小说-精准预演了拉美民粹政治的死循环/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/42df6b9f173f5224-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:03:08</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Conversations with Tyler</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1104</span></div>\n<h2>一本写于1904年的小说，精准预演了拉美民粹政治的死循环</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">小说里外国资本把矿业变成国家支柱，也带来发展，但煽动家和腐败将领轮番上位的循环从未被打破——这是拉美政治至今未解的死结。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">拉美政治</span><span class=\"tag\">发展经济学</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The New AI Agents That Shop, Plan, and Gossip OpenClaw Moltbook MCP picnic\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-04-a16z-ai助理最大的信任障碍不是隐私泄露-而是让你当众出丑/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">51:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1104</span></div>\n<h2>AI助理最大的信任障碍不是隐私泄露，而是让你当众出丑</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">用户嘴上说担心隐私，真正在意的是不被agent说漏嘴而丢脸——这才是阻碍信任、拖慢渗透的真正瓶颈。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI agent</span><span class=\"tag\">消费产品</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Martin Casado on Frontier Model Economics, AI&#x27;s Slowdown, and the Cursor Deal - [Invest Like the Best, EP.498] mythical man month NeoCloud NeoLab OLTP\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-04-ilt-最强模型拿下八成市场-但护城河只够撑三到六个月/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/5467ed92a069a36b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">1:05:13</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Invest Like the Best</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1104</span></div>\n<h2>最强模型拿下八成市场，但护城河只够撑三到六个月</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">只要市场还在扩张，最前沿的模型就能拿走八成支出；但模型的保质期只有三到六个月，一旦掉队几乎没有长尾可言，护城河随时清零。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力</span><span class=\"tag\">前沿模型经济学</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Big Beef: The War on Your Wallet | A Bloody Business | 1 boxed beef vertical integration Packers Consent Decree feedlot class action\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-04-businesswars-撤销一纸同意令-牛肉加工业集中度十年内翻倍/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d30f1b7fb3078628-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"B\"><span class=\"dur\">41:31</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Business Wars</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1104</span></div>\n<h2>撤销一纸同意令，牛肉加工业集中度十年内翻倍</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1981年里根政府放行后，四大肉企十年内从控制三成牛肉加工暴涨到控制八成，用并购而非技术垄断了市场。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">反垄断</span><span class=\"tag\">供应链议价权</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"徕芬科技创始人叶洪新×罗永浩！初中毕业后，我先造飞机去了...... FA\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-04-cn2d7912-读书只读到初中毕业-他把吹风机做到了全球销量第一/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9155e2c533270be3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"罗\"><span class=\"dur\">3:19:24</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">罗永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1104</span></div>\n<h2>读书只读到初中毕业，他把吹风机做到了全球销量第一</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他造载人飞行器、卖电动滑板车两次烧光借来的钱，却靠自学攒下的无刷电机技术，后来把吹风机做到戴森五分之一的价格，卖成全球销量第一。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">硬件创业</span><span class=\"tag\">国产替代</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"⚡️ The 2026 Software Factory Standard — Zach Lloyd, Warp.dev software factory harness scorers / online evals factory engineering ADLC/SDLC\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-03-latentspace-pr成本从80美元砍到20美元-不是换模型-是把工厂写成代码/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c081d94ef2cea125-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">34:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1103</span></div>\n<h2>PR成本从80美元砍到20美元，不是换模型，是把工厂写成代码</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Warp把内部软件工厂整个定义成代码并接入观测闭环后，靠「观察-测量-调优」把每个PR成本从80美元压到15到20美元，PR吞吐同时提升40%。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">软件工厂</span><span class=\"tag\">agent编排</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"3 new scandals show being a pain in the ass for AI labs is a legit job now | Rob Wiblin looped transformers chain of thought non-disparagement agreement federal preemption Not For Private Gain campaign\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-03-eightythousand-anthropic的法案让人几乎没法叫停危险的ai训练/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d70069c16841d26d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"8\"><span class=\"dur\">29:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">80,000 Hours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1103</span></div>\n<h2>Anthropic的法案让人几乎没法叫停危险的AI训练</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">法案把叫停权压缩成商务部长签字、一家特区法院45天内拍板，模型真出事时几乎来不及按下刹车。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI监管</span><span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"E208 A股又是大震荡，价值投资的实践、挑战和思考 | 永庆、David 对谈弘尚资产张骏\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-03-touzishizhan-亏钱不是a股的错-是你对它的认知不够/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/478f2b894977699e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"投\"><span class=\"dur\">1:27:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">投资实战派</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1103</span></div>\n<h2>亏钱不是A股的错，是你对它的认知不够</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">张骏复盘今年60多的累计回撤后发现，A股牛短熊长、资金久期短的根源，从来不是市场本身，而是投资者对公司内在价值和宏观周期的认知跟不上变化的速度。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">价值投资</span><span class=\"tag\">内在价值</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"老黄经济学：一口气看懂英伟达的商业帝国 Jevons Paradox DSXPORT Productive / Fungible / Durable circular financing ACIE\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-03-laoshi-下一财年-英伟达四分之一营收要靠自己给客户撑腰/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e1f942ceb55eb0d1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"老\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">老石谈芯</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1103</span></div>\n<h2>下一财年，英伟达四分之一营收要靠自己给客户撑腰</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">英伟达一边把GPU包装成可融资资产，一边自掏腰包投资AI实验室、帮客户垫钱买自己的芯片，循环融资撑起营收，也让应收账款飙到631亿美元。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力经济</span><span class=\"tag\">循环融资</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Roasting China&#x27;s AI Industry (中文版) benchmark RSI scaling law PMF\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-03-chinatalk-大模型是制造业不是魔法-谁都别想领先超过一个月/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ae93881f9f6bfed0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:03:35</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1103</span></div>\n<h2>大模型是制造业不是魔法：谁都别想领先超过一个月</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">丧钟AI的作者认为，大模型厂没有任何能保密的技术差异，数据和算力就是生产资料，这和光伏、手机、电动车的逻辑一样——谁的领先都撑不过一个月。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">国产大模型</span><span class=\"tag\">视频生成模型</span>\n</div></div></a>"]